                                "sense_id": "7f4a60df-ac4c-3ed4-9224-295d727a44f4",
                                "text": "A person at whom Inglis had a grudge, was owner of a beautiful garden and flower plot, in which he took great delight, priding himself on the beauty and variety of his flowers and he size and quality of his sybo and carrot beds."
